

<section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-layout">
            <div class="about-intro">
                <span class="section-eyebrow">// about</span>
                <h2 class="section-title about-title">Broad .NET experience, built for production</h2>
                <p class="about-text">
                    I'm a full-stack .NET developer who has shipped software for government agencies, consultancies and
                    product teams. I'm comfortable across the whole Microsoft stack &mdash; from the SQL Server schema and
                    Entity Framework data layer, through ASP.NET Core APIs, to Blazor and .NET MAUI front ends.
                </p>
                <p class="about-text">
                    Today I work remotely with engineering teams in Malta, maintaining and modernizing a large legacy
                    codebase while new features keep shipping.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-stats">
                <div class="stat-tile">
                    <span class="stat-value">@(CareerInfo.YearsOfExperience)+</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Years of professional .NET development</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-tile">
                    <span class="stat-value">6</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Organizations, from government to product teams</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-tile">
                    <span class="stat-value">Full-stack</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Database, API, web and mobile</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-tile">
                    <span class="stat-value">Remote</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Currently with teams in Malta</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="principles">
            <div class="principle">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.AccountTree" Class="principle-icon" />
                <div>
                    <h3 class="principle-title">Clean architecture</h3>
                    <p class="principle-text">Clear layers and boundaries so a codebase stays easy to change years later.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="principle">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Autorenew" Class="principle-icon" />
                <div>
                    <h3 class="principle-title">Modernize safely</h3>
                    <p class="principle-text">Refactor legacy systems step by step without breaking what's in production.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="principle">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Bolt" Class="principle-icon" />
                <div>
                    <h3 class="principle-title">Keep learning</h3>
                    <p class="principle-text">Adopting new framework features and AI tooling to deliver faster.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-section {
        padding: 80px 0;
        background-color: var(--gh-bg);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    }

    .about-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
        gap: 56px;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .about-title {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .about-text {
        color: var(--gh-text-muted);
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 14px;
    }

    .about-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 16px;
    }

    .stat-tile {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 24px;
        background: var(--gh-canvas);
        border: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .stat-tile:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        border-color: var(--gh-border-strong);
    }

    .stat-value {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--gh-text);
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .stat-label {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: var(--gh-text-muted);
    }

    .principles {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 24px;
        margin-top: 56px;
        padding-top: 40px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
    }

    .principle {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .principle .principle-icon {
        box-sizing: content-box;
        padding: 9px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: var(--gh-elevated);
        border: 1px solid var(--gh-border);
        color: var(--gh-green-4);
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .principle-title {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--gh-text);
        margin: 2px 0 6px;
    }

    .principle-text {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--gh-text-muted);
        margin: 0;
    }

    @@media (max-width: 992px) {
        .about-layout {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .principles {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
